WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.153 --> 00:00:02.248
- One time when I was a kid,
I found a dead baby bird

00:00:02.248 --> 00:00:06.064
on the sidewalk and I buried
it and then my dog dug it up

00:00:06.064 --> 00:00:08.567
and then ate it and then puked it back up,

00:00:09.557 --> 00:00:11.891
so I'm not really worried about this.

00:00:13.459 --> 00:00:18.459
("Gentleman's Club")

00:00:26.447 --> 00:00:27.564
- I grew up with a lot of Filipino folk

00:00:27.564 --> 00:00:30.333
and they always told me about balut.

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.766
- I've heard about balut before

00:00:31.766 --> 00:00:33.926
and I've always wanted to
try, I heard it's delicious.

00:00:33.926 --> 00:00:34.843
- Yeah, I regret this.

00:00:34.843 --> 00:00:35.772
- I'm excited.

00:00:35.772 --> 00:00:36.863
- Let's do this, there's dark magic

00:00:36.863 --> 00:00:38.012
and we're about to eat it.

00:00:39.382 --> 00:00:42.164
- What I was taught, you're
supposed to crack the top

00:00:42.164 --> 00:00:44.351
and then that forms like a little bowl

00:00:44.351 --> 00:00:46.069
and then you're supposed
to sip the soup out of it

00:00:46.069 --> 00:00:47.799
and then you just peel
this stuff and eat it.

00:00:47.799 --> 00:00:48.773
(laughing)

00:00:48.773 --> 00:00:49.597
- I'm so scared.

00:00:49.597 --> 00:00:53.578
- Oh, boy! Oh, that's
a baby bird in there!

00:00:53.578 --> 00:00:54.579
- Can I take it like a shot?

00:00:54.579 --> 00:00:55.247
- Yeah.

00:00:55.247 --> 00:00:56.087
- All right. Cheers!

00:00:56.087 --> 00:00:56.681
- Cheers!

00:00:56.681 --> 00:00:57.599
(imitating bird sounds)

00:00:58.729 --> 00:01:00.243
- Oh, that's actually pretty good.

00:01:00.243 --> 00:01:01.470
- Oh, it tastes just like broth.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:02.460
- Delicious.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.939
- Hmm, not as bad as
I thought it would be.

00:01:06.659 --> 00:01:07.742
(screechy voice)

00:01:07.742 --> 00:01:08.970
- Oh, my god!

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:11.870
- Oh, it's looking up at you,
yeah, that's pretty crazy.

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:13.141
- Are there bones in this?

00:01:16.961 --> 00:01:17.751
(laughing)

00:01:17.751 --> 00:01:18.866
- Eat that please.

00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:21.442
- I notice the bone, you're lying.

00:01:22.692 --> 00:01:24.230
(drowned out by food in mouth)

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.249
- I just squish and sprains, I think.

00:01:27.719 --> 00:01:29.420
- I never thought I would say these words,

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:31.178
the fetus tastes good.

00:01:31.178 --> 00:01:32.736
- The fetus does taste good.

00:01:32.736 --> 00:01:35.524
- If this was common, it
would not freak me out.

00:01:35.524 --> 00:01:36.976
This is just my first time.

00:01:36.976 --> 00:01:38.392
I was a little bit
anxious for my first time,

00:01:38.392 --> 00:01:39.997
but I don't think this is that bad.

00:01:39.997 --> 00:01:42.103
- If I ate this even one more time,

00:01:42.103 --> 00:01:43.407
I'm sure I'd be totally fine with it.

00:01:43.407 --> 00:01:45.010
- Is that your hair or bird hair?

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:45.718
- That's my hair.

00:01:45.718 --> 00:01:46.958
(laughing)

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:49.014
- I did it, I defeated you.

00:01:49.014 --> 00:01:52.334
No, high five myself,
you didn't eat anything.

00:01:52.334 --> 00:01:54.540
- I have a lot of respect for
the people who enjoy this.

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:56.458
This is-- you're hardcore
if you can eat this.

00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:57.994
- I don't even like hard-boiled eggs,

00:01:57.994 --> 00:01:59.020
I don't know why I'm here.

00:01:59.461 --> 00:02:04.252
("Gentleman's Club")

